1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
 - Here's the one thing that rich people do

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:04,600
 completely differently to middle class and poor people.

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,080
 From a millionaire businessman,

4
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:08,360
 poor people think money exists to pay bills

5
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:09,560
 and fund their lifestyle.

6
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:11,960
 Middle class people think money's for building credit

7
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:14,840
 so they can get loans to buy bigger houses and nicer cars.

8
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:18,120
 Rich people know the true function of money is expansion,

9
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:20,560
 which means using your money to make more money.

10
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:22,720
 Only when you see money for what it actually is

11
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:24,400
 will you become truly rich.

